                    {
                        "sense_id": "59e6be4c-33ef-3b6a-bc04-1ca775f35e84",
                        "entry_id": "24936c2e-a8b3-3440-bb99-5d40029f653a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A sword of Persian origin that features a curved blade."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fe974406-366f-4857-bcdd-90c457c5db71",
                                "sense_id": "59e6be4c-33ef-3b6a-bc04-1ca775f35e84",
                                "text": "The Prince of Morocco:\n[…]By this Symitare,\nThat ſlew the Sophie, and a Perſian Prince\nThat won three fields of Sultan Solyman,\nI would ore-ſtare the ſterneſt eies that looke,\nOut-braue the heart moſt daring on the earth:\nPlucke the yong ſucking Cubs from the ſhe Beare,\nYea, mocke the Lion when he rors for pray\nTo win the Ladie. […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6211a80c-b803-4a5e-92c8-b5b844b788e0",
                                "sense_id": "59e6be4c-33ef-3b6a-bc04-1ca775f35e84",
                                "text": "Next door is a room devoted to Albanian history (“what a lovely scimitar,” I find myself exclaiming, my reserves of small talk inadequate at the sight of the family’s sword collection),[…]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
